    ji "这让我想起开学初我们家发生的一次入室盗窃，有两个小偷闯进了我们的豪宅，偷走了我们的东西。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:203
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_a4fc6f3b:

    # ji "This was during the time you had your Hell Week."
    ji "这是你在地狱周的时候。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:205
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_021e98e8:

    # ji "Is there anything you'd like to tell me?"
    ji "你有什么想对我说的吗？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:207
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "..."

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:208
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_5548f252:

    # mc "I'm sorry... It was before I knew you."
    mc "对不起...那是在我认识你之前的事。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:210
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_1ac87104:

    # ji "[name]..."
    ji "[name]……"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:212
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_1a8d8116:

    # mc "We had to do it for Hell Week. They wanted us to take funny pictures in Tybalt's room. And we had to enter through your room."
    mc "我们为了地狱周不得不这么做。他们让我们在Tybalt的房间里拍些搞笑的照片，而且我们必须从你房间进去。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:213
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_f0b706ca:

    # mc "Your window was open."
    mc "你家的窗户是开着的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:215
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_6a35e59a:

    # ji "Did you steal from me and Tybalt?"
    ji "你偷了我的东西还有Tybalt的吗？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:217
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_766fbcc4:

    # mc "What? No!"
    mc "什么？不！"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:218
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_f5991264:

    # mc "Wait... Derek stole Tybalt's mounted deer head."
    mc "等等……Derek偷走了Tybalt的挂墙鹿头。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:221
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_d6b83602:

    # mc "And oh... I may have taken some of your money, but it wasn't a lot and it was just lying there."
    mc "而且……我可能拿了一些你的钱，但没拿多少，而且它就那么躺在那儿。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:223
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_3d53c3d4:

    # ji "Wasn't a lot...? Are you justifying the amount you stole from me? And because something lies somewhere, it's ok to take it?"
    ji "不是很多……？你是在为偷走我的东西找借口吗？东西随便躺在那儿就拿走，这就有道理了？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:225
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_6c97c66b:

    # mc "No... Fuck, I don't know why I did that. I didn't think clearly. I'll pay you back."
    mc "不...见鬼，我不知道自己为什么会这么做。我当时没想清楚。我马上还给你。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:229
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_38672d0f:

    # ji "It's not about the money, [name]. It's more about the underwear you stole and the feeling you left me feel."
    ji "这不关乎金钱，[name]更多是关于你偷走的内衣和你留在我心里的感觉。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:231
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_a205ef55:

    # ji "You stole my underwear and left me feeling horrible."
    ji "你偷了我的内衣，还让我感觉糟透了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:232
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_9da0cd62:

    # ji "I had trouble sleeping because I felt like my privacy was violated."
    ji "我睡不着觉，因为感觉我的隐私被侵犯了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:234
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_b963ca48:

    # mc "No! I never did that. Tybalt must have stolen those."
    mc "不！我从来没做过那事。Tybalt一定是偷的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:236
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_79124e41:

    # ji "Oh, [name]..."
    ji "哦，[name]..."

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:238
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_f88c44f4:

    # mc "I'm telling you the truth! When we were escaping through your window, we saw Tybalt in here. He was standing right over there!"
    mc "我跟你说实话！我们从你窗户逃出来的时候，看到Tybalt在里面。他正站在那边！"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:239
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_160a794e:

    # mc "It looked like he was smelling underwear from your dresser. He saw us and called on security, not that he'd ever admit that."
    mc "他看起来像是在闻你衣柜里的内衣。他看见我们了，叫了保安，虽说他这辈子都不会承认这一点。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:241
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_55eb393b:

    # mc "Jill... You have to believe me."
    mc "Jill……你一定要相信我。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:242
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_cf3078c2:

    # mc "I did a shitty thing because of Hell Week, and I should have told you sooner, but part of me wanted to forget about it."
    mc "我因为地狱周做了些蠢事，本该早点告诉你，但有一部分的我就是想把它忘了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:243
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_e9b2fb0b:

    # mc "And after getting to know you, I didn't think it mattered anymore."
    mc "认识你之后，我就没觉得那件事还有那么重要了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:245
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_b141d1c0:

    # mc "That person who did those things wasn't me. It's not who I am."
    mc "那个人做那些事的不是我。那不是我。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:246
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_5d9abcac:

    # mc "I didn't steal your underwear. Come on. You can't believe that."
    mc "我没偷你内裤。拜托，你不能这么相信我。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:247
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_ae756f62:

    # mc "With everything Tybalt has done to you and me... You have to see through him by now."
    mc "经历了你和我一起经历的一切，你早就该看穿他了吧。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:249
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_1949366b:

    # mc "And you know me. Don't you? You trust me, right?"
    mc "你了解我。不是吗？你信任我，对吧？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:251
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_b2cfacbf:

    # ji "I trust you, but this makes me feel weird."
    ji "我相信你，但这样让我感觉有点怪。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:253
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_0ac5b0bc:

    # mc "I'm so sorry. If you want, I can show you the pictures we took."
    mc "我真的很抱歉。如果你想的话，我可以给你看我们拍的照片。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:254
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_59c18da1:

    # mc "I don't want you to have any questions about this if you have any doubts."
    mc "我不想你有任何疑问，如果你有什么怀疑的话。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:255
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_5204683b:

    # mc "We can call Derek, and he'll tell you the same story. He was there with me."
    mc "我们可以打给Derek，他会告诉你同样的经过。他当时也在场。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:257
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_fa534dff:

    # ji "[name], it's too late for you to tell me this. I found out on my own. You should have told me a lot sooner."
    ji "[name]已经是你自己发现的了，现在说这些已经太晚了。你本该早点告诉我。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:259
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "..."

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:260
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_47a097be:

    # mc "You're right. I should have. And I'd like to think that I would have told you eventually. Not that it helps."
    mc "你说得对，我本该早点说的。我也希望我最终会告诉你。不过这已经没用了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:262
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_d8d0e36a:

    # mc "I'm sorry. Can you forgive me?"
    mc "对不起，你能原谅我吗？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:264
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_ed4c0d96:

    # ji "Of course, I can."
    ji "当然可以。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:265
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_f1a98782:

    # ji "And I believe you. If I couldn't trust you, I wouldn't be with you."
    ji "而且我相信你。如果我不信任你，我早就不会和你在一起了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:266
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_486e62e3:

    # ji "But I had to ask because this entire day I've walked around thinking that there was something you didn't tell me..."
    ji "但我不得不问，因为今天一整天我都一直在想，你是不是有什么事没告诉我……"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:267
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_cd975147:

    # ji "...and I was right."
    ji "……我确实是对的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:269
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_07b49a69:

    # ji "But hearing you tell the story, I have no reason to doubt you."
    ji "但听着你讲完故事，我没有任何理由怀疑你。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:270
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_d0a1f9d9:

    # ji "I can see it in your eyes. You're telling me the truth."
    ji "我能从你眼里看出来，你是在对我说实话。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:272
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_245e3e7a:

    # mc "Thank you... I really am."
    mc "谢谢...我真的是这么想的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:273
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_456ce7d9:

    # mc "I did a lot of bad things during Hell Week."
    mc "我在地狱周做了不少坏事。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:275
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_2e007522:

    # ji "I don't need to know what you did. I know that fraternity hazing is a bad thing."
    ji "我不需要知道你做了什么。我知道兄弟会的恶作剧是件坏事。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:276
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_a593299c:

    # ji "And you're allowed to have secrets, as long as our relationship isn't built on lies."
    ji "而且你也可以有秘密，只要我们的关系不是建立在谎言之上。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:283
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_891092c4:

    # ji "Don't look so sad. You can kiss me now."
    ji "别一副苦瓜脸。现在你可以亲我了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:285
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "..."

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:287
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_00ea0349:

    # ji "[name]?"
    ji "[name]？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:289
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_90c4dc76:

    # mc "Jill, I don't want to ruin this relationship. I want this to work. I don't feel good about myself right now."
    mc "Jill，我也不想毁掉我们的关系。我希望我们能继续走下去。现在我心里很难受。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:291
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_fb7ccde7:

    # ji "*{i}Smack{/i}*"
    ji "*{i}亲吻{/i}*"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:293
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_dc3787db:

    # ji "That's because you're a good person at heart and have a conscience."
    ji "那是因为你内心是个正派人，还有点良知。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:295
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_76a8253e:

    # ji "But maybe next time...you can figure out a way not to break in here."
    ji "但也许下次……你得想个办法别再闯进来了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:297
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_d5e3122d:

    # mc "I'll hammer it in that your room and privacy are off-limits."
    mc "我警告你，我的房间和隐私是绝对不能碰的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:304
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_3517d0a3:

    # mc "What about you? Are you ok?"
    mc "你呢？你没事吧？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:306
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_c77a71c0:

    # ji "I thought the problems surrounding us would disappear after we became a couple, but I guess that was naive."
    ji "我以为我们成为情侣后，围绕我们的问题就会消失，但看来我太天真了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:308
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_288f6c01:

    # mc "I don't think either of us could have anticipated this."
    mc "我觉得我们俩都没法预料到会发生这种事。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:310
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_963a4f01:

    # ji "It's been a wild day. It's fair to say there have been lots of surprises."
    ji "今天真是疯狂的一天。说起来，确实有很多意外发生。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:311
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_367f58d6:

    # ji "What Josy and Maya told me...that was another big one."
    ji "Josy和Maya告诉我的事……同样令我非常震惊。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:314
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_3d5c34dd:

    # ji "Can you help me wrap my head around something...?"
    ji "你能帮我理清楚这件事吗……？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:316
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_1abe311f:

    # mc "Around what?"
    mc "理清什么？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:318
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_6bbed88e:

    # ji "You told me you dated Josy and broke up with her... But Josy said she's with Maya..."
    ji "你告诉我，你和Josy交往过，后来分手了……可Josy又说她正在和Maya交往……"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:320
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_a97e2ec1:

    # mc "Do you remember that I said I broke up with two girls?"
    mc "你还记得我跟你说过我跟两个女孩分手过吗？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:322
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_72a128d4:

    # ji "Was Maya the other one?"
    ji "另一个人是Maya吗？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:324
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_1d75a79a:

    # mc "Yeah... We three dated each other... It's hard to explain it, but if you want to, I can do it."
    mc "嗯……我们三个人曾经互相交往……这很难解释，不过如果你想听，我可以说清楚。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:326
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_caa0584a:

    # ji "Maybe another time... Um..."
    ji "也许下次吧... 嗯..."

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:328
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_b06bb525:

    # mc "Jill... I know you might feel weird about this, but what should matter is that you're the only one for me now. Ok?"
    mc "Jill，我知道你可能会觉得尴尬，但现在对我来说，你才是唯一重要的。好吗？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:330
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_bb46a5fc:

    # ji "Still..."
    ji "即便如此……"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:331
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_e08289af:

    # ji "I feel sad for Maya... It can't be an easy situation for her."
    ji "我很替Maya难过……她现在的处境一定很煎熬。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:333
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_0f0595c4:

    # mc "I've known about it for quite some time and I want to help her with her problems."
    mc "我知道这件事已经有一段时间了，我想帮她解决这些问题。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:336
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_60602270:

    # mc "Yeah, I've known about it for quite some time."
    mc "嗯，我早就知道了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:337
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_032831d2:

    # mc "It's such a bad situation for Maya, and I want to help her with it."
    mc "Maya的处境太糟了，我想帮她。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:340
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_6036a7c5:

    # ji "I can see that..."
    ji "我明白你的意思。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:342
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_8cbd09c5:

    # ji "I can see that. I think that's wonderful of you."
    ji "我能看出来。我觉得你这么做真的很棒。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:343
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_a35b6d6a:

    # ji "But I'm honestly concerned. What you guys plan to do doesn't sound very...safe or legal."
    ji "但我真的担心。你们打算做的事情听起来一点都不……安全或者合法。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:345
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_e51172b4:

    # mc "What else can we do? If you have a suggestion, I'm all ears."
    mc "还有什么别的办法？如果你有什么建议，我洗耳恭听。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:347
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_8f64ba17:

    # ji "No, I don't have any suggestions. That's why I didn't speak up at the library."
    ji "不，我没什么好建议。这也是为什么我在图书馆的时候没出声。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:348
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_a245ecb1:

    # ji "This whole thing worries me... What if something bad happens at Thanksgiving? Will you guys be ok?"
    ji "这事儿让我挺担心的……要是感恩节出点什么事，你们能行吗？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:350
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_2866a5d8:

    # mc "I see it like this... Worst case scenario, we get caught and thrown out."
    mc "我这么想，最坏的情况就是我们被抓住然后被赶出去。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:352
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_b25ed96d:

    # ji "What if he reports you for rummaging around in his office?"
    ji "如果他举报你翻他办公室的东西怎么办？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:354
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_f0d3c8f2:

    # mc "Do you think what he's doing to Maya sounds legal? Because to me, it sounds like extortion."
    mc "你觉得他对Maya这么做合法吗？在我看来，这简直就是敲诈。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:356
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_ed509a25:

    # ji "I don't want you to end up doing something you will regret. That's all."
    ji "我不想你最后做些事后后悔的事。就这么简单。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:357
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_c6436c8f:

    # ji "Given what we just talked about, with the break-in... Can't you see why I'm concerned?"
    ji "考虑到我们刚刚谈的事情，还有那起闯入事件……你难道看不出来我为什么担心吗？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:359
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_5f36fcbe:

    # mc "I see it, but it's not the same thing. This is for a good cause."
    mc "我明白，但情况不一样。这是为了一个正当的理由。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:360
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_5d034b5c:

    # mc "This is the first time I felt like we can make a real difference for Maya."
