# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:376
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_de0732f1:

    # mc "I don't feel like I deserve you."
    mc "我不觉得我配得上你。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:378
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_811cf166:

    # ji "You're my boyfriend and I'm your girlfriend. It's not a promise we've made lightly to each other."
    ji "你是我的男朋友，我是你的女朋友。我们之间这份关系，不是随便说说的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:379
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_4da20f32:

    # ji "You're allowed to have a past and you're allowed to make mistakes... And even if things you tell me feel weird for me, you haven't ruined anything."
    ji "你可以有过去，也可以犯错……即使你对我说的话让我觉得奇怪，你也没毁掉什么。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:380
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_b75d49bd:

    # ji "You're being open and honest with me and that means a lot."
    ji "你对我很坦诚，这对我来说意义很大。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:381
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_6054e049:

    # ji "Weird or not... I want you here next to me because being with you is one of the best things I know too. And I'm done with letting that get affected by others."
    ji "不管听起来多奇怪……我想让你陪在身边，因为和你在一起也是我最珍惜的事之一。我受够了让别人影响我们的关系。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:383
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_ef5f4378:

    # mc "Thanks, Jill... That feels comforting to hear."
    mc "谢谢，Jill……听到这句话感觉挺安心的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:385
translate schinese ep10_jill_solo_label_ef5bab03:

    # mc "And I didn't think coming here tonight would do that. Being with you is the best thing I know. It's usually more relaxing."
    mc "而且我也没想到今晚来这儿会让我有这种感觉。和你在一起是我知道的最舒服的事，通常来说，这让我感觉更放松。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_jill_branch.rpy:387
